## Expected Workflow

1. Read the relevant docs and issue context first.
2. Prefer minimal diffs over broad rewrites.
3. Update tests when behavior changes.
4. Update docs when workflow, interface, or architecture changes.
5. Respect CODEOWNERS, branch protection, and review gates.

## Skills

